83:On GLM-5.3-Flash ( Qwen-3.8-27B ) at 10M tokens, D-LSA speeds up one attention layer by 22.7 × 22.7\times ( 72.4 × 72.4\times ) in prefill and 4.6 × 4.6\times ( 42.5 × 42.5\times ) in decode over its original sparse attention (full attention), while keeping similar accuracy across a variety of tasks.
